    {
      "annotations": {
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true,
        "openWorldHint": true,
        "readOnlyHint": true,
      },
      "description": "List tags. Without tag: every tag that can be applied to posts (about 1,010), alphabetically, as on the site's all-tags page. With tag = one of the 7 core tags (rationality, ai, world-modeling, world-optimization, practical, community, site-meta): all the tags grouped under it, in the forum's order (by score, then name); these groupings also include wiki-only pages (articles that can't be applied to posts), labelled. limit counts tags. Each tag shows its ids, page type, the site's count of tagged posts (~, it overcounts) and its parent. Placeholder pages (empty wiki stubs) are not listed; wiki-only pages outside the core groupings are found with find or search kind=tag. Open one with get_tag.

